    <bpmn:process id="W_W4475" name="W4475. Substance-Abuse Rehabilitation Provider Network &amp; Coverage" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Network setup; referral need; coverage review
Frequency: Per setup + ongoing governance
Volume: Rehabilitation provider network &amp; coverage
Owner: Occupational Health/EAP (VS-83/VS-83.3) / Procurement (VS-34) / Benefits (VS-102)
Participants: EAP/Occupational Health (VS-83/VS-83.3), Procurement (VS-34), Benefits (VS-102), Legal (VS-100), Compliance (VS-22), Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4475 — Substance-Abuse Rehabilitation Provider Network &amp; Coverage</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4475_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4475_Lane1" name="EAP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4475_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4475_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4475_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4475_Lane2" name="Benefits">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4475_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4475_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4475_Start4" name="Network setup; referral need; coverage review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4475_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4475_Task5" name="DOH-accredited rehabilitation provider network">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EAP/Procurement/Occupational Health build a DOH-accredited rehabilitation provider network (inpatient/outpatient, geographic coverage for BuildRight&#x27;s distributed sites), and contract with quality/confidentiality terms
Responsible (R): EAP / Procurement / Occupational Health / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal
Duration: Per setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4475_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4475_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4475_Task6" name="coverage">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Benefits/Occupational Health determine coverage — HMO/health-plan coverage of treatment, BuildRight-funded rehabilitation per policy (W4457), employee cost-share, and leave (medical/sick VS-19)
Responsible (R): Benefits / Occupational Health / HR
Accountable (A): Benefits Lead / CHRO
Duration: Per policy</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4475_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4475_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4475_Task7" name="EAP/Occupational Health govern provider performance (outcomes, confidentiality…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EAP/Occupational Health govern provider performance (outcomes, confidentiality, cost), review periodically, and ensure access across regions (links VS-141/VS-144 for distributed workforce)
Responsible (R): EAP / Occupational Health / Procurement
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4475_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4475_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4475_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4475_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-682 (ensure controlled execution — Rehabilitation, Return-to-Duty, Privacy &amp; Program Analytics (PA-150.3).) | - CTL-682: DOH-accredited provider network with regional coverage; quality/confidentiality contracted; coverage policy documented; performance governed
Owner: Occupational Health/EAP (VS-83/VS-83.3) / Procurement (VS-34) / Benefits (VS-102)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4475_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4475_Annotation9" targetRef="W4475_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
