      <bpmn:userTask id="W4479_Task6" name="alcohol">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR/HSE/Occupational Health/Legal extend the impairment policy beyond illicit drugs — alcohol (working under the influence), prescription/OTC medication impairment (safety-sensitive roles), and any legal-substance impairment, with testing/handling protocol
