        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Occupational Health/HR handle medication-impairment in safety-sensitive roles — legitimate-use accommodation vs safety (engage employee/physician, reassignment), balancing RA 10524/disability and safety duty
Responsible (R): Occupational Health / HR / Legal / Benefits
Accountable (A): CHRO / VP Legal
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
