        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4480_Start3" name="Governance cycle; Board/leadership reporting; program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4480_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4480_Task4" name="HR/Compliance/Governance establish program governance — ownership…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR/Compliance/Governance establish program governance — ownership (CHRO/Compliance), reporting cadence to leadership/Audit Committee, and the continuous-improvement loop (W4478)
Responsible (R): HR / Compliance / Governance
Accountable (A): CHRO / Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4480_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4480_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4480_Task5" name="HR/Compliance report program status — compliance posture (D.O. 53-03/RA 9165)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Compliance report program status — compliance posture (D.O. 53-03/RA 9165), metrics (W4478), incidents/cases, risks, and remediation — to leadership/Audit Committee
Responsible (R): HR / Compliance / Audit
Accountable (A): CHRO / Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly/annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4480_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4480_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4480_Task6" name="HR/Compliance/Audit drive continuous improvement — remediate audit findings…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/Compliance/Audit drive continuous improvement — remediate audit findings (W4477), tune program on analytics (W4478), adopt best practice, and measure program maturity
Responsible (R): HR / Compliance / Audit
Accountable (A): CHRO / Audit Committee
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4480_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4480_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4480_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4480_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-682 (ensure controlled execution — Rehabilitation, Return-to-Duty, Privacy &amp; Program Analytics (PA-150.3).) | - CTL-682: clear program ownership (CHRO/Compliance); regular leadership/Audit-Committee reporting; continuous-improvement loop; findings remediated; maturity measured
Owner: HR/CHRO (VS-103) / Compliance (VS-22) / Governance (VS-36) / Audit (VS-21)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
